{
    "version": "1.1.88",
    "description": "SSH workspace, SFTP, and terminals in one",
    "homepage": "https://netcatty.app",
    "license": "GPL-3.0",
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/binaricat/Netcatty"
    },
    "url": "https://github.com/binaricat/Netcatty/releases/download/v1.1.88/Netcatty-1.1.88-portable-win-x64.exe",
    "hash": "sha256:224152bf2a5a75891b666ac353ea9899a5a2d71ea2c27165ecf49418270e02ec",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/binaricat/Netcatty/releases/download/v$version/Netcatty-$version-portable-win-x64.exe"
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "$__wrapper = Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\*.exe\" | Select-Object -First 1",
        "Expand-7zipArchive $__wrapper.FullName \"$dir\\_nsis\"",
        "$__app7z = Get-ChildItem \"$dir\\_nsis\" -Recurse -Filter 'app-*.7z' | Select-Object -First 1",
        "Expand-7zipArchive $__app7z.FullName \"$dir\"",
        "Remove-Item \"$dir\\_nsis\" -Recurse -Force",
        "Remove-Item $__wrapper.FullName -Force",
        "New-Item -ItemType Directory \"$dir\\data\" -Force | Out-Null"
    ],
    "persist": "data",
    "bin": "Netcatty.exe",
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "Netcatty.exe",
            "Netcatty"
        ]
    ],
    "notes": [
        "NSIS 便携包装 exe 实际是 electron-builder 自解压包；安装时已解出内层 app-64.7z，主程序为 Netcatty.exe（避免每次启动向 temp 解压 127MB，也避免版本号文件名导致升级后 shim 失效）。",
        "程序检测到 exe 同目录存在 data 目录时，会把 userData/sessionData 指向该目录；data 已持久化到 D:\\scoop\\persist\\netcatty\\data，升级不丢配置。",
        "旧版数据在 %APPDATA%\\netcatty；如需迁移：完全退出 Netcatty 后，把该目录内容复制到 D:\\scoop\\persist\\netcatty\\data。"
    ]
}
